    "title": "\"Wildwood\" Teaser Features Pittock Mansion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Oregon Film ,\n1 days ago LAIKA recently released a new trailer for their upcoming feature film “Wildwood” that feature the iconic Pittock Mansion in Portland. The Mansion, one of Portland’s most iconic landmarks, has been reimagined from the ground up for the film. In this exclusive behind-the-scenes featurette, LAIKA’s artists and artisans reveal how they transformed a historic home into a symbol of mystery, power, and magic. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
